 process and it was like  once they jumped in action I had to just  go help really at that point it was kind  of all in or nothing type of situation  Spencer you you grabbed this guy a  member of an Isis cell he's got an ak-47  that's not all he was packing apparently  yeah what happened when you when you  tackled when I tackled him I was trying  to grab the a gate from him a little bit  I was practicing jujitsu at the time so  I kind of just went straight to that and  I that we both stood up I put him in a  rear naked choke slam myself against the  window so he's on top of me at this  point and he pulls out a pistol that he  had just shot the market medallion with  and he tries to shoot me with that but  luckily there was no ammunition in it  and Alek runs up prized the pistol out  of his hands as soon as the the pistol  it gets gets out of his hand he grabs a  box cutter  and starts cutting the back of my neck  almost trying to slit my throat with it  and then comes across and slices my left  thumb to the bone severs my tendon and  nerve and I looked over her shoulder saw  the knife and him kind of flailing  around I screamed he's got a knife and I  kicked him off me and then we all kind  of punched him and kicked him for a  little bit and I mean the fight went on  from there - but unbelievable do you  believe that there was a divine hand in  all of this in the way these events  transpired if you add up all the odds of  us being in that time in place and all  the circumstances that put us there all  the circumstances that went towards us  surviving it I mean that's going to be  in the movie too but it's just to me as  to astronomical to be coincidence so as  if all this wasn't terrifying enough  Anthony you all decide we're going to  approach Clint Eastwood with our book  and our story he decides to do this film  and cast you all as yourselves this had  to be a little intimidating having never  acted before you didn't do theater you  didn't do never school play or anything  nothing so we thought when he picked up  the picture that would be good enough  like this is the mountaintop he wants to  do our story we  that was great and then three weeks  before we start shooting we thought we  were meeting the actors who were playing  ourselves and he's like you mind  reenacted things for us on camera and  we're like sure we'll show the actors  for accuracy and he's like he says it  again and then we're like mysteries with  what do you mean here like he kind of  sound like you're asking us to be in the  movie he's like sure why not I think you  guys should be boys should just do it  Alec we used to have a lot of time with  him on the set Clint Eastwood yeah well  you spend a lot of time with him on set  I mean he worked longer days and we did  and we spent a lot of time with him  outside of said just hanging out getting  getting food getting drinks we even  would work out with them from time to  time and that's one of my favorite  memories of him is Spencer and I were  kind of talking smack to each other  about how many dips we could do and then  Clint comes in he's like oh yeah that's  nothing when I was 75 I could do 25 tips  and so we're like alright let's see what  you got now keep in mind he's 87 right  he hops up on the dip bar and just  knocks out ten body weight that's just  like nothing what did you learn from him  he gave us a lot more gems and showed us  a lot more about the industry in the  process than he had to to make the  picture so it felt like he was really  invested in us and he really wants to  see us and do well so we all want to  continue to pursue acting for sure  you're gonna continue this defense  absolutely I feel like he blessed us  with a great opportunity and he like  Anthony was saying he kind of raised  this world a little bit and we kind of  want to see what else we can do with it  and what do you want people to take away  from this experience given that Isis has  proven itself but this is the kind of  attacks they plan on enacting on the  public from now on even though these two  are off duty servicemen at the time that  we are three ordinary guys in that  ordinary people are gonna watch the film  and we don't have anything special in  our s3 it's we were just put in an  extraordinary situation and we hope that  people take that theme from the movie  that if they find themselves in a  situation with a terrorist or maybe any  obstacle that facing in their life that  they have the ability  to do something extraordinary themselves  if they do it together  most definitely thank you guys thanks  for being thank you

